      "text": "CLIMAX: both paths land in the\nsame tool (JWT Inspector) without\nvisiting grid-home. Palette =\ndeliberate keyboard search from\nany surface. Clipboard-suggestion\n= passive, inert-if-ignored \u2014\nAmara never had to remember or\nhunt for the right tool.",
