      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FAILURE PATH (Flow 4): a shape-based false positive\n(e.g. a dot-separated string that only resembles a JWT)\nstill surfaces the suggestion \u2014 detection is shape-based,\nnot validation-based. Opening it shows the tool's own\nprecise no-valid-input/error state, never a crash or a\nsilently wrong result.",
